.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr klab 8 ,
.Xr kzfs-test 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An kldload Aq Mt anthony@kldload.com
.Sh CAVEATS
Goldens and sites are removed with
.Ql zfs destroy -R ,
which takes every clone of them, whoever made them.
